/-! ## (A) THE LEADING CENSUS CARRIER — a defined `Cut`-combination of banked composed objects. -/

/-- THE LEADING COMPOSED CARRIER of `1/α(0)`: the way-point-consistent leading-κ composed object
    (the banked `+70`-recombined tower, MINUS the isospin anti-screening `−s·T` at `s = 1/8`, PLUS
    the freeze-out summand at the pinned edges). Physics-words-removable: a `Cut`-combination of the
    banked `invAlphaEM`, `totalScreeningWith`, `projectedS`, `totalScreening`, `freezeoutTail`. -/
def leadingCarrier (Mu Md Mlam : Cut) : Cut :=
  invAlphaEM (completeBandList chargeTraceDepth)
    - projectedS * totalScreeningWith 1 (completeBandList chargeTraceDepth)
    + totalScreening (freezeoutTail (edgeBottom Mu Md) (edgeCharm Mu Md) (edgeLight Md (Mlam ^ 2)))

